  "details": "You hold a key (Say z and x for sake of argument) and move your mouse around to move your right hand, and use another key for the left. You use the scroll wheel to adjust the extension of your arm and mouse 4/5 to rotate them. (Or alternatively another set of keys if a mouse lacks side buttons). Releasing the key locks the arms in that position and it can be saved and/reset by using the emote menu. For instance, a user with an avatar that can use a gun can make it look like they’re properly holding it, as opposed to casually holding it.",
